## Approach

Bootstrap the crate with a stateless architecture: `Ephemeris` holds only read-only config, all methods take `&self`. Core types use explicit discriminants with `TryFrom` for safe conversion from C integer IDs. `bitflags` crate for calculation flags. Comprehensive error enum replaces C's `serr` buffer. Internal structs (plan_data, file_data, etc.) deferred to their implementation phases — this scaffold covers only the public type surface and module wiring.

## Files

**Create (scaffold):**
- `Cargo.toml` — lib crate, edition 2024, deps: bitflags 2
- `src/lib.rs` — module declarations + re-exports
- `src/types.rs` — Body, FictitiousBody, HouseSystem, CalendarType, SiderealMode, EphemerisSource, model enums, AstroModels
- `src/flags.rs` — CalcFlags, SiderealBits, NodeBits, EclipseFlags, RiseSetFlags, HeliacalFlags, SplitDegFlags
- `src/constants.rs` — physical constants, reference epochs, tidal acceleration, validity ranges, offset constants, unit conversions
- `src/error.rs` — Error enum with Display + std::error::Error
- `src/context.rs` — EphemerisConfig, Ephemeris, CalcResult

**Create (empty stubs for future phases):**
- `src/date.rs`, `src/math.rs`, `src/precession.rs`, `src/moshier/mod.rs`, `src/calc.rs`, `src/sweph_file.rs`, `src/jpl.rs`, `src/ayanamsa.rs`, `src/stars.rs`, `src/houses.rs`, `src/eclipse.rs`, `src/phenomena.rs`, `src/heliacal.rs`

