### Step 6: constants.rs — Physical constants, epochs, ranges

All `pub const` values translated from swephexp.h, sweodef.h, sweph.h:

- Physical: AUNIT, CLIGHT, HELGRAVCONST, GEOGCONST, KGAUSS, EARTH_RADIUS, EARTH_OBLATENESS, SUN_EARTH_MRAT, EARTH_MOON_MRAT, MOON_MEAN_DIST/INCL/ECC, LIGHTTIME_AUNIT, PARSEC_TO_AUNIT, LAPSE_RATE
- Unit conversion: DEGTORAD, RADTODEG, CSTORAD, RADTOCS, CS2DEG, AUNIT_TO_KM, AUNIT_TO_LIGHTYEAR, AUNIT_TO_PARSEC
- Reference epochs: J2000, B1950, J1900, B1850
- Body offsets: AST_OFFSET, PLMOON_OFFSET, COMET_OFFSET, FICT_OFFSET, FICT_MAX
- Tidal acceleration: TIDAL_DE200 through TIDAL_DE441, TIDAL_DEFAULT, TIDAL_AUTOMATIC, DELTAT_AUTOMATIC
- Validity ranges: MOSHPLEPH_START/END, MOSHLUEPH_START/END, MOSHNDEPH_START/END, JPL_DE431_START/END, CHIRON_START/END, PHOLUS_START/END
- Solar system plane: SSY_PLANE_NODE_E2000, SSY_PLANE_NODE, SSY_PLANE_INCL
- Sentinel: TJD_INVALID
- Planetary diameters: array indexed by raw body ID (0-20)
- Centisecond angle constants: DEG, DEG15, DEG30, DEG60, DEG90, DEG120, DEG150, DEG180, DEG270, DEG360

See the code sketch in Step 5 of docs/phase-1-considerations.md and the full constant list extracted from the C headers for exact values.

### Step 7: context.rs — Ephemeris, Config, CalcResult

```rust
use std::path::PathBuf;
use crate::types::{SiderealMode, AstroModels};
use crate::flags::CalcFlags;

#[derive(Debug, Clone)]
pub struct EphemerisConfig {
    pub ephe_path: Option<PathBuf>,
    pub jpl_filename: Option<String>,
    pub sidereal_mode: Option<SiderealMode>,
    pub sidereal_t0: f64,
    pub sidereal_ayan_t0: f64,
    pub topographic: Option<TopoPosition>,
    pub astro_models: AstroModels,
    pub tidal_acceleration: Option<f64>,
}

#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy)]
pub struct TopoPosition {
    pub longitude: f64,
    pub latitude: f64,
    pub altitude: f64,
}

impl Default for EphemerisConfig {
    fn default() -> Self {
        Self {
            ephe_path: None,
            jpl_filename: None,
            sidereal_mode: None,
            sidereal_t0: 0.0,
            sidereal_ayan_t0: 0.0,
            topographic: None,
            astro_models: AstroModels::default(),
            tidal_acceleration: None,
        }
    }
}

pub struct Ephemeris {
    config: EphemerisConfig,
}

impl Ephemeris {
    pub fn new(config: EphemerisConfig) -> crate::Result<Self> {
        Ok(Self { config })
    }

    pub fn config(&self) -> &EphemerisConfig {
        &self.config
    }
}

pub struct CalcResult {
    pub data: [f64; 6],
    pub flags_used: CalcFlags,
}
```

